ipe cards with shadows and rounded corners. Icon-based ingredient tags. Clean tab navigation: Home, Search, Grocery, Saved.",\n      "isEnabled": true\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "React JS"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#FFFFFF",\n    "secondary": "#4CAF50",\n    "accent": "#FF7043"\n  },\n  "theme": "dark",\n  "layoutDescription": "The app features a bottom tab navigation with four main tabs: Home (quick search and recent recipes), Search (ingredient input and recipe results), Grocery (grocery list builder), and Saved (favorite recipes). Recipe results are displayed as cards with images, tags, and key info. Ingredient input supports both text and voice. Grocery list uses checkboxes and swipe-to-delete. Filters and currency toggle are easily accessible."\n}'}",
